{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943760/extras/226bbf6ebc58c48ed39b3c503de2757c.webp?t=1774482890\" width=616 height=63 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2b50Survive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carve your way through randomly generated maps. Face hordes of enemies and powerful bosses, collect treasure, and grow stronger with every battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943760/extras/7cd61adc838e2ca49ab7e54ee403a2d0.poster.avif?t=1774482890\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943760/extras/7cd61adc838e2ca49ab7e54ee403a2d0.webm?t=1774482890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943760/extras/7cd61adc838e2ca49ab7e54ee403a2d0.mp4?t=1774482890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2b50Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of unique characters, each with their own abilities. Venture across diverse worlds, discover hidden treasures, and interact with animals and NPCs to unlock new powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943760/extras/10592dae47f80e9b30d9b780a954d2b2.poster.avif?t=1774482890\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943760/extras/10592dae47f80e9b30d9b780a954d2b2.webm?t=1774482890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943760/extras/10592dae47f80e9b30d9b780a954d2b2.mp4?t=1774482890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2b50Upgrade &amp; </strong>enhancements</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is unique. Choose from upgrades, enhancements.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With hundreds of items to discover, experiment with different combinations to create powerful synergies. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate multiple worlds filled with random events.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist the game to stay updated on the latest news!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943760/extras/0838e3feb9aeb16892f23650a115bbf3.avif?t=1774482890\" width=1337 height=476 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3943760?t=1774482890","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3943760?t=1774482890","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943760/c0886e1d6fabf7f25fa10005ad4314776315c85f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774482890","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943760/c0886e1d6fabf7f25fa10005ad4314776315c85f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774482890","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></